## Executive Summary

Q4 2023 concluded an exceptional year with revenue of $27.0 million, representing 95.7% year-over-year growth. We ended the year with 412 customers and $95.8M ARR, setting a strong foundation for 2024.

### Key Metrics

| Metric | Q4 2023 | Q3 2023 | Q4 2022 | QoQ Change | YoY Change |
|--------|---------|---------|---------|------------|------------|
| Revenue | $27.0M | $23.8M | $13.8M | +13.4% | +95.7% |
| Gross Profit | $19.7M | $17.4M | $9.5M | +13.2% | +107.4% |
| Gross Margin | 73.0% | 73.1% | 68.8% | -0.1 pts | +4.2 pts |
| Operating Income | ($1.1M) | ($1.8M) | ($4.2M) | +38.9% | +73.8% |
| ARR (end of period) | $95.8M | $88.5M | $42.5M | +8.2% | +125.4% |
| Total Customers | 412 | 385 | 245 | +7.0% | +68.2% |

